data.examples#Examples:
Docker ComposeDocker CLI services: watchtower: image: nickfedor/watchtower:latest environment: WATCHTOWER_NOTIFICATION_URL: "gotify://gotify.example.com/TOKEN" volumes: - /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock docker run -d \ --name watchtower \ -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock \ nickfedor/watchtower \ --notification-url "gotify://gotify.example.com/TOKEN" Replace TOKEN with the application token from your Gotify server. Use your server’s host name in place of gotify.example.com.
